### BLOWMAGGY demo path — open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (or copy into Postman/Bruno).
@api = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@xrw = X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

### Health
GET {{api}}/health

### Home (departments + picks + deals)
GET {{api}}/home

### Department page
GET {{api}}/departments/fashion

### Search "black" across departments with filters
GET {{api}}/search?q=black&dept=fashion&size=M&priceMax=2000&sort=relevance

### Autocomplete
GET {{api}}/search/suggest?q=bl

### Product detail (variants, look, reviews summary)
GET {{api}}/products/ivory-chikankari-cotton-kurta

### Login as shopper (copy accessToken below)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{{xrw}}

{ "email": "shopper@blowmaggy.demo", "password": "Demo@123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Add to cart (take a variantId from the product detail response)
POST {{api}}/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{{xrw}}

{ "variantId": "PASTE_VARIANT_ID", "qty": 1 }

### View unified cart (grouped by department, server-priced)
GET {{api}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Apply coupon
POST {{api}}/cart/coupon
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{{xrw}}

{ "code": "MAGGY10" }

### Checkout (UPI) — uses the default saved address
# @name checkout
POST {{api}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-{{$guid}}
{{xrw}}

{ "paymentMethod": "UPI" }

### Verify payment (mock mode accepts signature "mock"; "mock-fail" simulates a decline)
POST {{api}}/payments/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
{{xrw}}

{ "razorpay_order_id": "{{checkout.response.body.data.razorpayOrderId}}", "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_demo_1", "razorpay_signature": "mock" }

### Track the order
GET {{api}}/orders/{{checkout.response.body.data.orderNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── Admin ──
# @name admin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{{xrw}}

{ "email": "admin@blowmaggy.demo", "password": "Demo@123" }

###
@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Dashboard KPIs
GET {{api}}/admin/stats?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Orders list
GET {{api}}/admin/orders?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Advance a shipment one step (Placed → Packed → Shipped → Out for delivery → Delivered)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/shipments/PASTE_SHIPMENT_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
{{xrw}}

{}

### Low-stock inventory
GET {{api}}/admin/inventory?lowStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
